## 6. CI/CD dengan GitHub/GitLab untuk Pangkalan Data

### Contoh Pipeline GitLab CI untuk Ujian dengan PostgreSQL
```yaml
test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.10
  services:
    - postgres:13
  variables:
    POSTGRES_DB: test_db
    POSTGRES_USER: tester
    POSTGRES_PASSWORD: "testpass"
    DATABASE_URL: "postgresql://tester:testpass@postgres/test_db"
  before_script:
    - pip install -r requirements.txt
  script:
    - pytest
```

### Contoh GitHub Actions untuk Migrasi Django
```yaml
name: Run Migrations
on:
  push:
    branches: [ main ]
jobs:
  migrate:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    services:
      postgres:
        image: postgres:13
        env:
          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: postgres
        options: >-
          --health-cmd pg_isready
          --health-interval 10s
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      - name: Set up Python
        uses: actions/setup-python@v4
        with:
          python-version: '3.10'
      - name: Install dependencies
        run: pip install -r requirements.txt
      - name: Run migrations
        env:
          DATABASE_URL: postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost/postgres
        run: python manage.py migrate
```

